        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>First Impressions Reed and Crystal Pull</b>\r\n<p>\r\nBack to back pair of classic elegant reed handles fitted with Austrian 24% lead crystal ends for a truly OMG!  The shimmering crystals are 1-1/2\" in diameter and 1-5/8\" long.  \r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nMade in the USA by the master craftsmen at First Impressions from the finest materials. These are perfect for your glass doors.\r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> for First Impressions PR-CFRB-CR/12CTC Crystal Pulls \r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Mounting Center to Center: 12\" C/C</li>\r\n<li>Pull Handle Length: 17-13/16\"</li>\r\n<li>Pull Handle Diameter: 1\"</li>\r\n<li>Total Projection: 3-1/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Pull Handle Material: Reeded Brass Tubing</li>\r\n<li>Crystals: 24% Lead Crystal</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/kaba-simplex-902-size.gif?v=1704354717\" width=\"100\" height=\"72\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Made in the USA\">\r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\nNote: These crystal door pulls are handmade in the USA when you order it—allowing it to be custom designed to fit your specific door application, including <b>Other Lengths</b> up to 4 feet. Unfortunately, because of the made-to-order nature of the door handle, it is <b>Not Returnable.</b> Please <a href=\"/pages/contact\">Contact Us</a> with your requirements or if you have any questions.\r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\nPackaged with Back to Back mounting (2 door pulls bolted to each other - 1 door pull for each side of a door). Includes lock down threaded rosettes to securely tighten the door pulls to the door. \r\n<br>\r\nAlso available: Individual <a href=\"/products/reed-and-crystal-pull-first-impressions-cfrb-cr-18\"><b>First Impressions Model# CFRB-CR Crystal  Door Pull</b></a> for one side of a door.\r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\n<b>*Sold as a Pair (2 Door Pulls) with Back to Back mounting</b>.\r\n</p>",
            "seo": {
                "title": "Reed and Crystal Pulls, Pair, First Impressions PR-CFRB-CR/12CTC",
                "description": "Back to back pair of classic elegant reed handle fitted with Austrian 24% lead crystal ends for a truly OMG!  The shimmering crystals are 1-1/2 inches in diameter and 1-5/8 inches long.  Made in the USA by the master craftsmen at First Impressions from the finest materials. These are perfect for your glass doors.",
